            "Replace the serial iteration driver with a persistent OpenMP parallel region.",
            "Statically partition both row-major phases and combine the strict per-cell error predicate through an integer OR reduction.",
            "Keep the separate full stencil and interior-copy phases unchanged semantically."
          ]
        },
