            "Replace per-row allocations with two contiguous field buffers.",
            "Split the independent stencil write from convergence inspection and mark the stencil loop as dependency-free for GCC vectorization.",
            "Swap fully initialized buffers after each iteration instead of copying interior values."
          ]
        },
